From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Flysoft <flysoftbeta@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 06:09:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 26/27] WIP: capture and compose owned popup scenes with
 working menu input

Qualify real app-menu pixels and pointer selection across three scale factors, CPU/GPU transport and one/two negotiated credits. Preserve bounded source scheduling and premultiplied alpha. Broader flyout qualification remains incomplete.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

